From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: abhay-byte <abhay02delhi@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] panvk: enable vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics on v13 and v14
 by default biblioklept

v10-v12 expose vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics since 078 (memory-writing
pre-rasterization stages run through gpu_prerast). v13+ kept the
upstream drirc opt-in, so DXVK capped v13/v14 at FL11_0. On v13+ the
hardware no longer speculatively references invalid indices and the
compiler already lowers IDVS VS atomics (bifrost_nir_lower_vs_atomics),
so the upstream IDVS path is used there (078 only reroutes v10-v12).

Make pan_enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics default true for v10-v14;
pan_enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics=false (drirc or environment)
turns it off on every arch. v9 JM stays off.

Generated-by: LLM
Purpose: DXVK FL11_1 on v10-v14
Tested GPU: none (v13/v14 not hardware-tested; v10-v12 path unchanged)
Dependencies: csf-v11/078
---
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_drirc_gen.py b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_drirc_gen.py
index 3f91aa5..abd061d 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_drirc_gen.py
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_drirc_gen.py
@@ -28,9 +28,10 @@ def declare_options():
             "Bitmask of shader cores that may be used for fragment jobs. "
             "If unset, defaults to scheduling across all available cores.",
             c_name="fragment_core_mask"),
-        B("pan_enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics", False,
-          "Enable vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics on v13+ (This cannot work on older "
-          "generation because of speculative behaviors around vertices)",
+        B("pan_enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics", True,
+          "Enable vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics on v10+ (v10-v12 run memory-writing "
+          "pre-rasterization stages through gpu_prerast, v13+ through IDVS; "
+          "set false to disable)",
           c_name="enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics"),
         B("pan_force_enable_shader_atomics", False,
           "Enable fragmentStoresAndAtomics and vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics on any "
diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
index d4f2b7f..83d4f67 100644
--- a/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/panfrost/vulkan/panvk_vX_physical_device.c
@@ -341,10 +341,11 @@ panvk_per_arch(get_physical_device_features)(
       .pipelineStatisticsQuery = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
       /* On v13+, the hardware isn't speculatively referencing to invalid
          indices anymore. On v10-v12, pre-rasterization stages that write
-         memory run through gpu_prerast compute instead of IDVS. */
+         memory run through gpu_prerast compute instead of IDVS. On by default
+         on v10+ (DXVK FL11_1); pan_enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics=false
+         turns it off. */
       .vertexPipelineStoresAndAtomics =
-         (PAN_ARCH >= 10 && PAN_ARCH < 13) ||
-         (PAN_ARCH >= 13 && instance->drirc.misc.enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics) ||
+         (PAN_ARCH >= 10 && instance->drirc.misc.enable_vertex_pipeline_stores_atomics) ||
          instance->drirc.misc.force_enable_shader_atomics,
       .fragmentStoresAndAtomics = true,
       .shaderTessellationAndGeometryPointSize = PAN_ARCH >= 10,
-- 
